Начало строительства космодрома намечено на 2027 год

## Summary
SpaceX plans to begin construction of a new spaceport dedicated to its Starship launch vehicle in Louisiana. The start of construction is scheduled for 2027.

## Key Points
- SpaceX will build a new spaceport specifically for Starship operations
- The new launch site will be located in Louisiana
- Construction of the spaceport is scheduled to begin in 2027


